Inspect or recover an interrupted engine operation

Usage: empack recover [OPTIONS] [ACTION]

Arguments:
  [ACTION]
          Possible values:
          - inspect: Show interrupted publication and available recovery actions
          - finish:  Finish publishing the verified candidate
          - restore: Restore changes owned by the interrupted operation
          
          [default: inspect]

Options:
      --operation <OPERATION>
          Require the exact operation reported by inspection

      --state-dir <STATE_DIR>
          Durable operation and recovery storage, separate from disposable
          caches
          
          [env:
          EMPACK_STATE_DIR=/Users/zer0cell/production/rules/terminal/evidence/20261123T225211680511Z-journeys/work/empack/state]

      --cache-dir <CACHE_DIR>
          Disposable cache root; previews only inspect existing objects
          
          [env:
          EMPACK_CACHE_DIR=/Users/zer0cell/production/rules/terminal/evidence/20261123T225211680511Z-journeys/work/empack/cache/empack]

  -y, --yes
          Run without prompts; unresolved content choices still fail
          
          [env: EMPACK_YES=]

      --dry-run
          Preview changes without publishing project, instance or durable state
          
          [env: EMPACK_DRY_RUN=]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
